From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Martin Blumenstingl <martin.blumenstingl@googlemail.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Dec 2024 23:49:01 +0100
Subject: arm64: dts: amlogic: g12: switch to the new PWM controller binding

Use the new PWM controller binding which now relies on passing all
clock inputs available on the SoC (instead of passing the "wanted"
clock input for a given board).

Signed-off-by: Martin Blumenstingl <martin.blumenstingl@googlemail.com>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/amlogic/meson-g12-common.dtsi             | 33 ++++++++--
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/amlogic/meson-g12a-fbx8am.dts             |  4 --
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/amlogic/meson-g12a-radxa-zero.dts         |  4 --
